_of_commute_single","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityBCentrality.mem_center_of_commute_single","kind":"theorem","line":321,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityBCentrality.lean#L321-L328","doc":"Commuting with every `single g 1` ⟹ in the center. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityBCentrality.commute_all_of_commute_single","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityBCentrality.commute_all_of_commute_single","kind":"theorem","line":311,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityBCentrality.lean#L311-L319","doc":"Commuting with every `single g 1` ⟹ commuting with everything (linearity). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityBCentrality.centralC2_classFun","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityBCentrality.centralC2_classFun","kind":"theorem","line":296,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityBCentrality.lean#L296-L307","doc":"**THE CLASS-FUNCTION PROPERTY.** The coefficient of `centralC2` is constant on conjugacy\nclasses, assembled from the three cycle-type cases (`1` / 3-cycle / other). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityBCentrality.conj_eq_one_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityBCentrality.conj_eq_one_iff","kind":"theorem","line":287,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityBCentrality.lean#L287-L294","doc":"Conjugation preserves being the identity. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityBCentrality.isThreeCycle_conj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityBCentrality.isThreeCycle_conj","kind":"theorem","line":281,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityBCentrality.lean#L281-L285","doc":"`IsThreeCycle` is conjugation-invariant. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityBCentrality.centralC2_apply_threecycle","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityBCentrality.centralC2_apply_threecycle","kind":"theorem","line":140,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityBCentrality.lean#L140-L279","doc":"**THE COMBINATORIAL CORE (now proved).** `centralC2 σ = 1` for a 3-cycle `σ`:\nexactly one triple `(k,i,j)` with `i,j < k` has `swap(i,k)·swap(j,k) = σ` — namely `k = max(supp σ)`\nwith `i = σ⁻¹(k)`, `j = σ(k)` (the other ordering gives `σ⁻¹`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityBCentrality.centralC2_apply_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityBCentrality.centralC2_apply_one","kind":"theorem","line":107,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityBCentrality.lean#L107-L110","doc":"`centralC2` at the identity permutation is `binom(n,2)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityBCentrality.centralC2_apply_other","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityBCentrality.centralC2_apply_other","kind":"theorem","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityBCentrality.lean#L85-L105","doc":"`σ` neither `1` nor a 3-cycle ⟹ `centralC2 σ = 0` (CharZero-free: the card is `0` in `ℕ`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityBCentrality.swap_prod_classify","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityBCentrality.swap_prod_classify","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityBCentrality.lean#L76-L83","doc":"`swap(i,k)·swap(j,k)` is `1` (when `i=j`) or a 3-cycle (when `i,j,k` are distinct). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityBCentrality.centralC2_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityBCentrality.centralC2_apply","kind":"theorem","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityBCentrality.lean#L55-L74","doc":"Coefficient expansion of `centralC2` at a permutation `σ`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}